      "created_at": "2017-06-25T15:03:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The quote from Twitter is \"Apple's record of ruining launch days remains intact\", which is probably a bit hyperbolic and full of in the moment frustration.</p><p><span>As a long time iOS only SOTM player, I know it has often had issues with major updates getting to me at the same time as other platforms, but it's always resolved in a reasonable amount of time, so I don't feel like it's worth documenting.</span></p>",
